SUMMARY:La Fanciulla Del West - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season @ WTW Wad
 ebridge
DESCRIPTION:La Fanciulla Del West - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season (2h 2
 0min)\n★★★★★\n\nGiancarlo Del Monaco’s atmospheric production brings to co
 lorful life a 19th-century mining camp during the California Gold Rush. At
  the center of the action is the good-hearted bar owner Minnie\, sung by B
 arbara Daniels\, who takes a motherly interest in the miners. Plácido Domi
 ngo is Dick Johnson\, also known as the bandit Ramerrez\, who falls in lov
 e with Minnie. Sherrill Milnes sings Jack Rance\, the sheriff who is not o
 nly determined to capture Ramerrez but also wants Minnie for himself. Bloo
 dshed\, a crooked poker game\, a snowstorm\, and a near lynching ensue bef
 ore Minnie and her bandit-turned-lover can ride off to start a new life. L
 eonard Slatkin conducts one of Puccini’s most colorful scores.\n\nStarring
 : Plácido Domingo\, Barbara Daniels\, Sherrill Milnes\, Anthony Laciura\, 
 Julien Robbins\, Charles Anthony\n\nFilm release at WTW Cinemas Wadebridge
 \nBook tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebridge/film/5559/la-fanciulla
 -del-west-royal-ballet-opera-2627-season\n\nFilm details: https://evenwebb
